~ PJailStare
do player.SetAnimationPanel("PJail/PStare")
She stares.
- Who are you?
	She holds out her closed hands
	She opens them revealing nothing inside
	=> PJailStare
- Are you ok?
	She points towards your arm
	- Reach in
		do player.SetAnimationPanel("PJail/PBite")
		do PlaySFX("Bleed")
		The small girl bites into your arm
		do player.AdjustBlood(-13)
		She drinks the flowing blood
		- Owwwiee
		- Arghhhh
		- Yeep
		She stops drinking and grabs the metal bars of the cage.
		do player.SetAnimationPanel("PJail/PBars")
		do PlaySFX("MeltMetal")
		do ChangeSpriteFrame(1)
		do set_collision_layer_value(5, false)
		do DeactivateChild(3)
		do DeactivateChild(4)
		Within her hands the metal melts with an orange glow.
		do player.HideAnimationPanel()
		There now stands a hole through the bars, and before you can say anything the child disappears into the dark.
		You pick up a small match from the ground.
		set interacted = true
		=> END
	- Ignore
