~ PetruTalk
Petru: Yes dear?
- What Do You Do?
	Petru: I am the churche's teacher.
	Petru: We take in all sorts of misled and lost youth and so I am here to show you guidance.
	Petru: I also do all the churches engravings for 15 silver.
	set interacted2 = true
	=> PetruTalk
- Engravings? [if interacted2]
	Engravings are cuts in the flesh to strengthen the connection between soul and body.
	That symbol you have for example connects your body to the leviathans' soul
	Though the engravings I do simply strengthens the body in particular skills your soul admires.
	=> PetruTalk
- The Sea Cult?
	Petru: The Sea Church rejects the corruption and sins plaguing the modern world and see working with devils, namely leviathan, as a necessary evil.
	Petru: Soon the world will be cleansed of evil through a great flood and the surviving remnants will be blessed with a new world.
	Petru: Do you believe in this vision?
	- Yes
	- No
	Petru: I see.
	=> PetruTalk
- What Are You? [if interacted3]
	Petru: I am but a teacher, nothing more.
	=> PetruTalk
- Return
=> Petru

