~ Oven
A cooking pot boils with a strange reddish colour over etherial purple flames.
if interacted == false
	set interacted = true
	You see something shiny in the flames
- Inspect Shiny Thing
	set interacted2 = true
	In the flames sits a golden scimitar constantly burning
	It seems to be the source of these flames
	if player.GetStat(2) >= 2
		You recognise these purple flames may be the power of the legended Burning Devil
		It's flames will not extinguish until it's fuel is consumed.
	=> Oven
- Grab the Scimitar [if interacted2 == true and interacted3 == false]
	do player.OpenSkillCheck(14, 1)
	set interacted3 = true
	if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == true
		Dodging the flames you grab the swords hilt, which is oddly cold, and pull it out.
		do player.AddItemPath("Weapons/MagicWeapons/Flametongue")
	if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == false
		Your hand brushes the purple flames and catches alight.
		You pull it from the oven and feel a heat stronger than you've ever experienced.
		The purple flame continues to climb your arm.
		- Wave Your Arm
			The flame continues to climb your arm as you frantically wave it trying to put it out.
		- Pour Water [if player.HasItem("Water Vial")]
			The flame continues to burn and climb despite the water.
		- Cut Off Arm [if player.GetBody().GetRandomArm() != null and player.HasItem("Bonesaw") or player.HasItem("Meat Cleaver")]
			do player.OpenSkillCheck(10, 0)
				if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == true
					do player.GetBody().GetRandomArm().TakeDamage(999)
					You manage to cut off your arm before the purple flame reaches something vital.
					=> END
				if player.GetSkillCheckSuccess() == false
					You don't manage to cut free your arm before your entire body is engulfed by the flame.
					Nothing you do can free you of the flame, you die here experiencing unimaginable pain.
					do player.KillPlayer()
					=> END
	=> Oven
